"Ushia's Seers of Itonia combine her Insights with a leyline under their cave."
"She uses wizardry to see and nudge fate in a fight; fate-reading is the lower form of fate-weaving."
"She believes the gaps in mana pools are filled by Davrar itself."
"Her foresight Talents are useless on Nathan Lark, whose outcomes Davrar cannot predict."
"Years later she teaches Stella wizardry and Nathan hand-to-hand fighting in Keihona."
"Nathan breaks her leg in a spar, working on her foresight in the aether."
"She tells Nathan to leave alone the deeper magic beyond wizardry."
"After Sussu dies, she and Garna seize Esebus as a 'continuity council'."
"With Brox and Sarya she hunts down and kills the last Questor contesting Esebus."
"In the Ostren war she gives prophecies for the Ashen side."
"At the Conclave she is a reliable duelist for the Heirs' side and knows aetherwalking's dangers."
